From d0b28ac0bbb498d75add3c207fefa7fb6484a5bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Tue, 17 Mar 2026 23:24:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Configure build for GrapheneOS GSI: apps and packages
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adapt the AOSP build configuration for GrapheneOS GSI:

- Replace generic webview module with TrichromeWebView (Vanadium)
- Use GrapheneOS TrichromeChrome as browser (replaces Browser2)
- Remove QuickSearchBox (not in GrapheneOS)
- Remove Camera and Messaging from GSI product — users install
  from GrapheneOS App Store to save system image space
- Remove packages that are not useful or not desired in GSI builds:
  Calendar (deprecated, CalendarProvider kept), MusicFX, Auditor
  (requires hardware attestation), PdfViewerGOS, InfoApp,
  DeviceDiagnostics, EasterEgg, HardeningTestApp,
  LiveWallpapersPicker (deprecated), PhotoTable, WallpaperPickerGOS,
  ContactsGOS (use AOSP Contacts), BluetoothViewerGOS, TalkBackGOS
  (use standard TalkBack included in handheld_product.mk),
  GrapheneOS Updater (only useful for official GrapheneOS devices)
---
 target/product/base_system.mk         | 3 ---
 target/product/generic/Android.bp     | 3 +--
 target/product/gsi/Android.bp         | 7 ++-----
 target/product/handheld_product.mk    | 5 -----
 target/product/handheld_system.mk     | 3 ---
 target/product/handheld_system_ext.mk | 1 -
 6 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

diff --git a/target/product/base_system.mk b/target/product/base_system.mk
index 2f2ccc9..33ce2a6 100644
--- a/target/product/base_system.mk
+++ b/target/product/base_system.mk
@@ -230,8 +230,6 @@ PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
     mke2fs \
     mkfs.erofs \
     monkey \
-    misctrl \
